# Documentation rules

After every task, keep these files up to date. Write their content in Brazilian Portuguese.

- `README.md`: what the project is, how to run it with Docker, the main features available so far and the demo user (once it exists).
- `docs/route-map.md`: every page and API route, with method, path, who can access and what it returns.
- `docs/product-vision.md` is owned by the author. Never edit it. If something in it must change, say so in the "Atenção" section of the delivery.
- When a feature is added, update the demo seeder so the demo user has realistic data for it.